msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingClosure|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gmn envelope security-ring closure"
msgstr "gmn 信封安全环闭合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingClosure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The class-scoped closed-world authority requiring every gmeow:GmnEnvelope to carry gmeow:gmnSecurityRing; its paired universal restriction fixes the value type without creating an existential witness."
msgstr "以类为作用域的闭世界权威：要求每个 gmeow:GmnEnvelope 都携带 gmeow:gmnSecurityRing；与之配对的全称限制固定了取值类型，而不产生存在性见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnEnvelopeCorrespondenceClosure|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gmn envelope correspondence closure"
msgstr "gmn 信封对应闭合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnEnvelopeCorrespondenceClosure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The class-scoped closed-world authority requiring every gmeow:GmnEnvelope to carry gmeow:gmnEnvelopeCorrespondence; its paired universal restriction fixes the value type without creating an existential witness."
msgstr "以类为作用域的闭世界权威：要求每个 gmeow:GmnEnvelope 都携带 gmeow:gmnEnvelopeCorrespondence；与之配对的全称限制固定了取值类型，而不产生存在性见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnRingLevelClosure|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gmn ring level closure"
msgstr "gmn 环级别闭合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnRingLevelClosure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The class-scoped closed-world authority requiring every gmeow:GmnSecurityRing to carry gmeow:gmnRingLevel; its paired universal restriction fixes the value type without creating an existential witness."
msgstr "以类为作用域的闭世界权威：要求每个 gmeow:GmnSecurityRing 都携带 gmeow:gmnRingLevel；与之配对的全称限制固定了取值类型，而不产生存在性见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gmnSecurityRing is functional"
msgstr "gmnSecurityRing 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnSecurityRing is functional: a gmeow:GmnEnvelope names exactly one admission ring, because the ring IS the single boundary class the serializer checked the payload against — two rings on one envelope would leave the admission decision undetermined. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnSecurityRing 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:GmnEnvelope 恰好命名一个准入环，因为该环正是序列化器据以校验有效载荷的唯一边界类——同一信封上出现两个环会使准入判定悬而未决。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:gmnSecurityRing and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:gmnSecurityRing (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：本记录只承载关于 gmeow:gmnSecurityRing 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:gmnSecurityRing 的定义（定义位于该术语自身之上），不是形状，也不是第二处陈述该术语含义的地方——与其扩大本记录，不如将其退役。"

# --- GMN logic symbology plane: signature type discipline (sorts, arity, associativity, arg roles/slots) and the logic glyph sign chains ---

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgIndex|rdfs:label"
msgid "gmn argument index"
msgstr "gmn 参数索引"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgIndex|skos:definition"
msgid "The zero-based ordinal position of an operand slot in a GMN operator signature. Domain gmeow:GmnArgSlot, range xsd:nonNegativeInteger (stated in prose). Indexes are unique per operator and, in strict canonical mode, zero-based and contiguous; operand order is carried by this integer, never by RDF list ordering, mirroring lang:slotIndex."
msgstr "GMN 操作符签名中某操作数槽位的从零起算的序数位置。定义域 gmeow:GmnArgSlot，值域 xsd:nonNegativeInteger（以散文陈述）。索引在每个操作符内唯一，且在严格规范模式下从零起算且连续；操作数次序由该整数承载，绝不由 RDF 列表排序承载，与 lang:slotIndex 相仿。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GmnArgRole|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN Argument Role"
msgstr "GMN 参数角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GmnArgRole|skos:definition"
msgid "The closed argument-role vocabulary of GMN operator signatures: the named role an ordered operand slot fills. Its instances are exactly the six named individuals gmeow:gmnArgRoleAntecedent, gmeow:gmnArgRoleConsequent, gmeow:gmnArgRoleContext, gmeow:gmnArgRoleSuccedent, gmeow:gmnArgRoleOverAccessibility and gmeow:gmnArgRoleBody. A gmeow:GmnArgSlot names its role through gmeow:gmnArgRole, binding the slot to the canonical logic: carrier it fills (e.g. gmeow:gmnArgRoleAntecedent to logic:antecedent, gmeow:gmnArgRoleOverAccessibility to logic:overAccessibility) so an operator's operands are named, not merely positional. It is the slot's ROLE, NOT its syntactic sort gmeow:GmnSort and NOT its ordinal gmeow:gmnArgIndex."
msgstr "GMN 操作符签名的闭合参数角色词表：有序操作数槽位所充当的具名角色。其实例恰为六个具名个体 gmeow:gmnArgRoleAntecedent、gmeow:gmnArgRoleConsequent、gmeow:gmnArgRoleContext、gmeow:gmnArgRoleSuccedent、gmeow:gmnArgRoleOverAccessibility 与 gmeow:gmnArgRoleBody。gmeow:GmnArgSlot 通过 gmeow:gmnArgRole 命名其角色，将槽位绑定到它所充当的规范 logic: 载体（例如 gmeow:gmnArgRoleAntecedent 对应 logic:antecedent，gmeow:gmnArgRoleOverAccessibility 对应 logic:overAccessibility），使操作符的操作数具名，而不仅是按位置的。它是槽位的角色，而非其语法种类 gmeow:GmnSort，也非其序数 gmeow:gmnArgIndex。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRole|rdfs:label"
msgid "gmn argument role"
msgstr "gmn 参数角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRole|skos:definition"
msgid "Names the role an operand slot fills. Domain gmeow:GmnArgSlot, range gmeow:GmnArgRole (stated in prose). Binds the slot to the canonical logic: carrier it renders (e.g. gmeow:gmnArgRoleAntecedent to logic:antecedent, gmeow:gmnArgRoleOverAccessibility to logic:overAccessibility) so an operator's operands are named, not merely positional."
msgstr "命名操作数槽位所充当的角色。定义域 gmeow:GmnArgSlot，值域 gmeow:GmnArgRole（以散文陈述）。将槽位绑定到它所呈现的规范 logic: 载体（例如 gmeow:gmnArgRoleAntecedent 对应 logic:antecedent，gmeow:gmnArgRoleOverAccessibility 对应 logic:overAccessibility），使操作符的操作数具名，而不仅是按位置的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleAntecedent|rdfs:label"
msgid "antecedent role"
msgstr "前件角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleAntecedent|skos:definition"
msgid "The antecedent role: the operand slot that fills the canonical logic:antecedent — the hypothesis of an implication. Paired with the consequent role."
msgstr "前件角色：充当规范 logic:antecedent 的操作数槽位——蕴涵式的假设。与后件角色成对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleBody|rdfs:label"
msgid "body role"
msgstr "主体角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleBody|skos:definition"
msgid "The body role: the operand slot that fills the scoped body of a binder — the formula a quantifier (logic:forall / logic:exists) or a modal operator (logic:necessarily / logic:possibly) ranges over."
msgstr "主体角色：充当绑定算子受辖主体的操作数槽位——量词（logic:forall / logic:exists）或模态算子（logic:necessarily / logic:possibly）所辖的公式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleConsequent|rdfs:label"
msgid "consequent role"
msgstr "后件角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleConsequent|skos:definition"
msgid "The consequent role: the operand slot that fills the canonical logic:consequent — the conclusion of an implication. Paired with the antecedent role."
msgstr "后件角色：充当规范 logic:consequent 的操作数槽位——蕴涵式的结论。与前件角色成对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleContext|rdfs:label"
msgid "context role"
msgstr "语境角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleContext|skos:definition"
msgid "The context role: the operand slot that fills the canonical logic:sequentContext — the premise context Γ of a sequent. Paired with the succedent role."
msgstr "语境角色：充当规范 logic:sequentContext 的操作数槽位——相继式的前提语境 Γ。与后承角色成对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleOverAccessibility|rdfs:label"
msgid "over-accessibility role"
msgstr "可达关系角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleOverAccessibility|skos:definition"
msgid "The over-accessibility role: the operand slot that fills the canonical logic:overAccessibility — the typed accessibility relation a modal operator is evaluated over. Its slot sort is the accessibility-type sort."
msgstr "可达关系角色：充当规范 logic:overAccessibility 的操作数槽位——模态算子据以求值的带类型可达关系。其槽位种类为可达类型种类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleSuccedent|rdfs:label"
msgid "succedent role"
msgstr "后承角色"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgRoleSuccedent|skos:definition"
msgid "The succedent role: the operand slot that fills the canonical logic:sequentSuccedent — the conclusion φ of a sequent. Paired with the context role."
msgstr "后承角色：充当规范 logic:sequentSuccedent 的操作数槽位——相继式的结论 φ。与语境角色成对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GmnArgSlot|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN Argument Slot"
msgstr "GMN 参数槽位"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GmnArgSlot|skos:definition"
msgid "An ordered, named operand slot in a GMN operator signature: a reified carrier holding exactly one zero-based gmeow:gmnArgIndex (operand position), one gmeow:gmnArgSort (the operand's syntactic sort, a gmeow:GmnSort), and one gmeow:gmnArgRole (the named role it fills, a gmeow:GmnArgRole). An operator declares its slots through gmeow:gmnOperandSorts; slot order is carried by the integer gmeow:gmnArgIndex, never by RDF list ordering, mirroring the lang:FormSlot idiom so two encodings of one signature are one signature. It is the position-and-role carrier, NOT the operand value itself and NOT the sort or role vocabularies it points at."
msgstr "GMN 操作符签名中一个有序、具名的操作数槽位：一个具体化载体，恰持有一个从零起算的 gmeow:gmnArgIndex（操作数位置）、一个 gmeow:gmnArgSort（操作数的语法种类，一个 gmeow:GmnSort）与一个 gmeow:gmnArgRole（它所充当的具名角色，一个 gmeow:GmnArgRole）。操作符通过 gmeow:gmnOperandSorts 声明其槽位；槽位次序由整数 gmeow:gmnArgIndex 承载，绝不由 RDF 列表排序承载，与 lang:FormSlot 惯用法相仿，使同一签名的两种编码为同一签名。它是位置与角色的载体，而非操作数值本身，也非它所指向的种类或角色词表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgSort|rdfs:label"
msgid "gmn argument sort"
msgstr "gmn 参数种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArgSort|skos:definition"
msgid "Names the syntactic sort of one operand slot. Domain gmeow:GmnArgSlot, range gmeow:GmnSort (stated in prose). Exactly one sort per slot; the operand-level counterpart of the operator-level gmeow:gmnResultSort."
msgstr "命名某个操作数槽位的语法种类。定义域 gmeow:GmnArgSlot，值域 gmeow:GmnSort（以散文陈述）。每个槽位恰一种类；是操作符级 gmeow:gmnResultSort 在操作数级的对应物。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GmnArityKind|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN Arity Kind"
msgstr "GMN 元数种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GmnArityKind|skos:definition"
msgid "The closed arity-kind vocabulary of GMN operators: the shape of an operator's operand count. Its instances are exactly the three named individuals gmeow:gmnArityKindFixed (a fixed operand count carried by gmeow:gmnArity), gmeow:gmnArityKindVariadic (an unbounded operand run, as for flattened logic:and / logic:or) and gmeow:gmnArityKindBinder (a variable-binding operator such as logic:forall / logic:exists / the modal box and diamond, whose quantifier body scope is marked by gmeow:gmnMaximalScope). An operator names its arity kind through gmeow:gmnArityKind. It is the arity SHAPE, NOT the integer count gmeow:gmnArity, which a fixed-arity operator additionally carries."
msgstr "GMN 操作符的闭合元数种类词表：操作符操作数个数的形态。其实例恰为三个具名个体 gmeow:gmnArityKindFixed（由 gmeow:gmnArity 承载的固定操作数个数）、gmeow:gmnArityKindVariadic（无界的操作数序列，如展平后的 logic:and / logic:or）与 gmeow:gmnArityKindBinder（一个绑定变量的操作符，如 logic:forall / logic:exists / 模态方盒与菱形，其量词主体辖域由 gmeow:gmnMaximalScope 标记）。操作符通过 gmeow:gmnArityKind 命名其元数种类。它是元数的形态，而非整数个数 gmeow:gmnArity——后者由固定元数操作符另行携带。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArityKind|rdfs:label"
msgid "gmn arity kind"
msgstr "gmn 元数种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArityKind|skos:definition"
msgid "Names the arity kind of a GMN operator — fixed, variadic, or binder. Domain a GMN operator sign, range gmeow:GmnArityKind (stated in prose). Exactly one arity kind per operator; a fixed operator additionally carries the integer gmeow:gmnArity, and a binder carries gmeow:gmnMaximalScope."
msgstr "命名 GMN 操作符的元数种类——固定、可变或绑定。定义域为 GMN 操作符符号，值域 gmeow:GmnArityKind（以散文陈述）。每个操作符恰一种元数种类；固定操作符另行携带整数 gmeow:gmnArity，绑定算子携带 gmeow:gmnMaximalScope。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArityKindBinder|rdfs:label"
msgid "binder arity"
msgstr "绑定元数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArityKindBinder|skos:definition"
msgid "Binder arity: the operator binds one or more variables over a body — the shape of the quantifiers logic:forall and logic:exists and the modal operators logic:necessarily and logic:possibly, whose body-scope extent is marked by gmeow:gmnMaximalScope."
msgstr "绑定元数：该操作符在一个主体上绑定一个或多个变量——量词 logic:forall 与 logic:exists 以及模态算子 logic:necessarily 与 logic:possibly 的形态，其主体辖域的范围由 gmeow:gmnMaximalScope 标记。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArityKindFixed|rdfs:label"
msgid "fixed arity"
msgstr "固定元数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArityKindFixed|skos:definition"
msgid "Fixed arity: the operator takes a fixed operand count, carried by the integer gmeow:gmnArity — the shape of logic:not (one) or logic:antecedent+logic:consequent implication (two)."
msgstr "固定元数：该操作符取固定的操作数个数，由整数 gmeow:gmnArity 承载——logic:not（一元）或 logic:antecedent+logic:consequent 蕴涵（二元）的形态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArityKindVariadic|rdfs:label"
msgid "variadic arity"
msgstr "可变元数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnArityKindVariadic|skos:definition"
msgid "Variadic arity: the operator takes an unbounded operand run — the shape of the flattened logic:and and logic:or, whose canonical identity absorbs nesting."
msgstr "可变元数：该操作符取无界的操作数序列——展平后的 logic:and 与 logic:or 的形态，其规范恒等式吸收嵌套。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssocAssociative|rdfs:label"
msgid "fully associative"
msgstr "完全结合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssocAssociative|skos:definition"
msgid "Full associativity: grouping is immaterial because the operator is semantically associative and flattens under its canonical identity — the reading of conjunction and disjunction."
msgstr "完全结合性：分组无关紧要，因为该操作符在语义上可结合并在其规范恒等式下展平——合取与析取的读法。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GmnAssociativity|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN Associativity"
msgstr "GMN 结合性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GmnAssociativity|skos:definition"
msgid "The closed associativity value vocabulary of GMN operators: how a run of one operator at equal gmeow:gmnPrecedence groups. Its instances are exactly the four named individuals gmeow:gmnAssocLeft, gmeow:gmnAssocRight, gmeow:gmnAssocNone and gmeow:gmnAssocAssociative. An operator names its grouping through gmeow:gmnAssociativity, resolving precedence ties the integer gmeow:gmnPrecedence leaves open. It is a grouping discipline, NOT the binding-strength integer gmeow:gmnPrecedence and NOT the placement value gmeow:GmnFixity."
msgstr "GMN 操作符的闭合结合性取值词表：同一操作符在相等 gmeow:gmnPrecedence 下的一个序列如何分组。其实例恰为四个具名个体 gmeow:gmnAssocLeft、gmeow:gmnAssocRight、gmeow:gmnAssocNone 与 gmeow:gmnAssocAssociative。操作符通过 gmeow:gmnAssociativity 命名其分组，解决整数 gmeow:gmnPrecedence 所遗留的优先级并列。它是一种分组规程，而非绑定强度整数 gmeow:gmnPrecedence，也非放置取值 gmeow:GmnFixity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssociativity|rdfs:label"
msgid "gmn associativity"
msgstr "gmn 结合性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssociativity|skos:definition"
msgid "Names the associativity of a GMN operator. Domain a GMN operator sign, range gmeow:GmnAssociativity (stated in prose). Exactly one of the four closed associativity individuals per operator; resolves equal-gmeow:gmnPrecedence grouping the integer precedence leaves open."
msgstr "命名 GMN 操作符的结合性。定义域为 GMN 操作符符号，值域 gmeow:GmnAssociativity（以散文陈述）。每个操作符恰为四个闭合结合性个体之一；解决整数优先级所遗留的相等 gmeow:gmnPrecedence 分组。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssocLeft|rdfs:label"
msgid "left-associative"
msgstr "左结合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssocLeft|skos:definition"
msgid "Left associativity: an equal-precedence run groups from the left, so a ∘ b ∘ c parses as (a ∘ b) ∘ c."
msgstr "左结合性：相等优先级的序列自左分组，故 a ∘ b ∘ c 解析为 (a ∘ b) ∘ c。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssocNone|rdfs:label"
msgid "non-associative"
msgstr "非结合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssocNone|skos:definition"
msgid "Non-associativity: an equal-precedence run does not chain, so a ∘ b ∘ c is a parse error requiring explicit bracketing."
msgstr "非结合性：相等优先级的序列不链接，故 a ∘ b ∘ c 是需要显式括号的解析错误。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssocRight|rdfs:label"
msgid "right-associative"
msgstr "右结合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnAssocRight|skos:definition"
msgid "Right associativity: an equal-precedence run groups from the right, so a ∘ b ∘ c parses as a ∘ (b ∘ c) — the usual reading of implication."
msgstr "右结合性：相等优先级的序列自右分组，故 a ∘ b ∘ c 解析为 a ∘ (b ∘ c)——蕴涵的通常读法。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnBelnapBilatticeWork|rdfs:label"
msgid "Belnap four-valued logic"
msgstr "Belnap 四值逻辑"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnBelnapBilatticeWork|skos:definition"
msgid "The four-valued relevance-logic reference cited for the raw truth values (told-true, told-false, the over-determined glut, the under-determined gap) and their result-level verdicts that the GMN logic glyph plane renders. GMN draws a coherent, visually-distinct geometric-shape family for the eight grade signs rather than a conventional notation, since the four-valued algebra has no single established typography; the Belnap reading supplies the semantics while the shapes stay pairwise non-confusable."
msgstr "为 GMN 逻辑字形平面所呈现的原始真值（被断言为真、被断言为假、过定盈余、欠定空缺）及其结果级裁决所引用的四值相干逻辑参考文献。GMN 为这八个等级符号绘制一族连贯且视觉可辨的几何形状，而非采用某种约定记法，因为该四值代数没有单一确立的排印方案；Belnap 读法提供语义，而诸形状两两保持不可混淆。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBelnapBoth|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: Belnap both as ◉"
msgstr "GMN 候选：Belnap 二者皆为 ◉"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBelnapBoth|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited adoption record for rendering the raw glut value logic:BelnapBoth as ◉ in @ℒ records."
msgstr "针对将原始过定值 logic:BelnapBoth 在 @ℒ 记录中渲染为 ◉ 的已审定采纳记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBelnapFalse|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: Belnap false as ○"
msgstr "GMN 候选：Belnap 假为 ○"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBelnapFalse|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited adoption record for rendering the raw truth value logic:BelnapFalse as ○ in @ℒ records."
msgstr "针对将原始真值 logic:BelnapFalse 在 @ℒ 记录中渲染为 ○ 的已审定采纳记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBelnapNeither|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: Belnap neither as ◌"
msgstr "GMN 候选：Belnap 二者皆非为 ◌"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBelnapNeither|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited adoption record for rendering the raw gap value logic:BelnapNeither as ◌ in @ℒ records."
msgstr "针对将原始欠定值 logic:BelnapNeither 在 @ℒ 记录中渲染为 ◌ 的已审定采纳记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBelnapTrue|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: Belnap true as ●"
msgstr "GMN 候选：Belnap 真为 ●"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBelnapTrue|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited adoption record for rendering the raw truth value logic:BelnapTrue as ● in @ℒ records."
msgstr "针对将原始真值 logic:BelnapTrue 在 @ℒ 记录中渲染为 ● 的已审定采纳记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBottom|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: falsum ⊥"
msgstr "GMN 候选：falsum ⊥"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicBottom|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited named-key ruling for the falsum constant logic:Bottom rendered ⊥."
msgstr "针对 falsum 常量 logic:Bottom（呈现为 ⊥）的已审定命名键裁定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicCompose|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: lens composition ∘"
msgstr "GMN 候选：透镜复合 ∘"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicCompose|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited named-key ruling for lens / correspondence composition logic:compose rendered ∘, kept distinct from math:functionComposition by its @ℒ scope and `after` key."
msgstr "针对透镜／对应复合 logic:compose（呈现为 ∘）的已审定命名键裁定，通过其 @ℒ 范围与「after」键而与 math:functionComposition 保持相异。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicConceptIntersection|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: concept intersection ⊓"
msgstr "GMN 候选：概念交 ⊓"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicConceptIntersection|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited named-key ruling for the DL concept-intersection constructor logic:conceptIntersection rendered ⊓, kept distinct from the sentence connective logic:and."
msgstr "针对描述逻辑概念交构造子 logic:conceptIntersection（呈现为 ⊓）的已审定命名键裁定，与语句连接词 logic:and 保持相异。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicConceptUnion|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: concept union ⊔"
msgstr "GMN 候选：概念并 ⊔"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicConceptUnion|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited named-key ruling for the DL concept-union constructor logic:conceptUnion rendered ⊔, kept distinct from the sentence connective logic:or."
msgstr "针对描述逻辑概念并构造子 logic:conceptUnion（呈现为 ⊔）的已审定命名键裁定，与语句连接词 logic:or 保持相异。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicDerives|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: derivability turnstile ⊢"
msgstr "GMN 候选：可推导性断定符号 ⊢"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicDerives|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited named-key ruling for the syntactic derivability turnstile logic:derives rendered ⊢, kept distinct from the semantic ⊨."
msgstr "针对语法可推导性断定符号 logic:derives（呈现为 ⊢）的已审定命名键裁定，与语义的 ⊨ 保持相异。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicEntails|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: entailment turnstile ⊨"
msgstr "GMN 候选：蕴涵断定符号 ⊨"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicEntails|skos:definition"
msgid "The audited named-key ruling for the semantic entailment turnstile logic:entails rendered ⊨, kept distinct from the syntactic ⊢."
msgstr "针对语义蕴涵断定符号 logic:entails（呈现为 ⊨）的已审定命名键裁定，与语法的 ⊢ 保持相异。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnCandidateLogicEquivalent|rdfs:label"
msgid "GMN candidate: logic:equivalentClass as ≡"
msgstr "GMN 候选：logic:equivalentClass 为 ≡"

